# A Pioneer's Best (Imaginary) Friend (adoulin 75, call-only), Ionis on before the quest begins: a level 99 Warrior in
# Western Adoulin, SoA Life on the Frontier current, the quest accepted (GMs). Ruth: 503 (the default's turn),
# then 2523, finished: Ionis. The quest set available again (a GM; Ionis stays). Merleg: 543, then 2520, finished:
# added, and with Ionis on the finish starts 2522 itself (player:startEvent from the finish: it plays in the same step);
# 2522 finished: completed, 500 exp, 200 bayld, the F.A.I.L. Badge, 30 Adoulin fame.
lists WesternAdoulin/Merleg/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/Ruth/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2520
lists WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2522 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2523
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=-142.5,4,-10 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Soa LifeOnTheFrontier current
quest Adoulin.APioneersBestImaginaryFriend accepted
login
trigger Ruth                            # 2523 or 503 (the turn)
finish-if-event
trigger Ruth                            # the other; 2523's finish: Ionis
finish-if-event
quest Adoulin.APioneersBestImaginaryFriend available # a GM
warp 32.5,0,-131 WesternAdoulin         # beside Merleg
trigger Merleg                          # available: 2520 or 543
finish-if-event
trigger Merleg                          # the other; 2520's finish: added; Ionis on: 2522 started
finish-if-event
finish                                  # 2522's finish: completed, exp, bayld, the badge, fame
